==English==

===Etymology===
From {{affix|en|tenant|-cy}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|tenancies}}

# The [[occupancy]] of [[property]], etc., under a [[lease]], or by paying [[rent]].
# The [[period]] of occupancy by a [[tenant]].
# The property occupied by a tenant.

